- * require video playback will need an FFmpeg/libav integration here.
+ * Video decoder. With PS3RECOMP_HAVE_FFMPEG (CMake finds libavcodec,
+ * libavutil and libswscale through pkg-config) every AU goes through
+ * libavcodec -- MPEG-2, AVC and MPEG-4 Part 2 (DivX / XviD) -- and
+ * cellVdecGetPicture converts the picture to the format the title asks for.
+ * Without FFmpeg every AU is one black picture, so titles that pace their
+ * movies on PICOUT/GetPicture still run through them.
+ *
+ * Behaviour (which codec types map to which decoder, the picture formats,
+ * the CellVdecDivxInfo layout) follows RPCS3's Emu/Cell/Modules/cellVdec.cpp
